{
  "_readme": [
    "Case table for src/pipeline/dedupe.js (05 §3 Phase 3 tasks 7-8, 03 §2).",
    "Records are written in the COMPACT form described by fieldMap: every key is expanded",
    "to its canonical column and every unmentioned canonical column is null, so a case",
    "shows only the fields it is about. sub/archivo/hoja/fila become record.provenance.",
    "The `keyOrder` section is different on purpose: those records are LITERAL, with all 18",
    "canonical columns spelled out, because the property under test is JSON key INSERTION",
    "ORDER (BUG-21) and a builder would destroy it.",
    "Everything marked \"measured\" comes from src/ReporteConsolidado.xlsx - the last real run."
  ],

